.randosay(1) -- a wrapper around fortune

NAME
       randosay - a wrapper around fortune to make it more fun

SYNOPSIS
       randosay [options]

DESCRIPTION
       randosay - a wrapper around fortune to make it more fun by adding cowsay ponysay and lolcat with a horizontal rule 


USAGE
       just run `randosay` and you'll get fortunes wrapped in cowsay or ponysay or lolcat with a horizontal rule

